<title>THAILAND: Siam City Bank faces 7.16 pct bad loans.</title>
<headline>Siam City Bank faces 7.16 pct bad loans.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siam City Bank Plc said on Thursday its non-performing loans stood at 7.16 percent of total lending at end-June.</p>
<p>Siam City Bank said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand its doubtful and sub-standard loans amounted to 14.23 billion baht in mid-1997, for which it set aside 6.30 billion baht of reserves.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (6520642)</p>
